abstract: >-
  Core assets for the TraCE-LLM study on identifying hidden instabilities
  in Large Language Model evaluation. Includes benchmark test splits
  (ARC-Challenge, MMLU, HellaSwag), an N=500 evaluation sample, human
  evaluation baselines, aggregated statistics, curated illustrative examples,
  and the complete analysis pipeline as Jupyter notebooks.
